      "text": "Can't have that",
      "start": 95.5
    },
    {
      "end": 103.72000122070312,
      "text": "If we're gonna survive this, take a bus, we got a backpack",
      "start": 98.33999633789062
    },
    {
      "end": 106.45999908447266,
      "text": "Gotta rewind that",
      "start": 103.91999816894531
    },
    {
      "end": 109.44000244140625,
      "text": "Gotta find a way to make it past",
      "start": 106.45999908447266
    },
    {
      "end": 115.45999908447266,
      "text": "All the hate that we're givin' to each other",
      "start": 109.58000183105469
    },
    {
      "end": 119.54000091552734,
      "text": "Talkin' murder, rape, killin', what you doin' with that?",
      "start": 116.0199966430664
    },
    {
      "end": 122.58000183105469,
      "text": "Dictatorship of my leadership",
      "start": 120.04000091552734
    },
    {
      "end": 125.16000366210938,
      "text": "Ayy, we need promised lands",
      "start": 122.58000183105469
    },
    {
      "end": 129.75999450683594,
      "text": "Like we promised ourselves from the beginning, yeah",
      "start": 126.45999908447266
    },
    {
      "end": 132.60000610351562,
      "text": "We need promised lands",
      "start": 129.75999450683594
    },
    {
      "end": 137.36000061035156,
      "text": "There's gonna be something other than death, yeah",
      "start": 133.5
    },
    {
      "end": 144.16000366210938,
      "text": "Then you're movin', tellin' me why, why you shootin' that?",
      "start": 139.3000030517578
    },
    {
      "end": 152.0800018310547,
      "text": "And I'm sayin' fuck you, you're takin' mine, you're takin' my youngest born, you're takin' everything that I have",
      "start": 144.94000244140625
    },
    {
      "end": 155.22000122070312,
      "text": "How am I supposed to build",
      "start": 152.55999755859375
    },
    {
      "end": 159.94000244140625,
      "text": "When it's all lies",
      "start": 156.8000030517578
    },
    {
      "end": 164.89999389648438,
      "text": "Lies, lies, lies, lies, lies in your promised land",
      "start": 161.10000610351562
    },
    {
      "end": 168.94000244140625,
      "text": "I can never see you here",
      "start": 166.24000549316406
    },
    {
      "end": 176.22000122070312,
      "text": "Or maybe angels fly from the chest of the old that you gave us",
      "start": 169.5800018310547
    },
    {
      "end": 179.63999938964844,
      "text": "Help us find the prom",
      "start": 176.44000244140625
    },
    {
      "end": 182.72000122070312,
      "text": "Mess up our souls, yeah, prom",
      "start": 179.8000030517578
    },
    {
      "end": 184.9600067138672,
      "text": "Of the past and the aim",
      "start": 182.72000122070312
    },
    {
      "end": 188.6999969482422,
      "text": "Comin' from from you to all to make a circle of it",
      "start": 184.9600067138672
    },
    {
      "end": 195.4600067138672,
      "text": "Let's not keep the pain inside and find our promised land",
      "start": 188.6999969482422
    },
    {
      "end": 199.77999877929688,
      "text": "Oh, take my hand",
      "start": 197.52000427246094
    },
    {
      "end": 205.89999389648438,
      "text": "It's a jungle, we can circle, kill it, take it, make it, be it, better come around",
      "start": 200.8000030517578
    },
    {
      "end": 210.3800048828125,
      "text": "I know you can, can't you hear me too, man?",
      "start": 205.89999389648438
    },
    {
      "end": 214.5,
      "text": "And woman, and woman, promise, promise me",
